    "$t": "光景bóng uē - 三峽ê日子"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p></p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《三峽ê日子》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">陳榮廷</span></span></h1><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhFlmwPL0K9n19aN9h_bHH4zuupohtpl7sIgfGDpBSeN_xnaU4KXgN11uMkIklo1OD1VqOQEUcC8MI3G8m2TUuowavxhVS4aL7SH3ccv928qYvdtahRDE5MsNb4nWMY5A6WjWQYy07ttTmMXzVRlTR73T2SonIlzPrnMngP4pa8F9XOU-iBBIruWRjOxkWD\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiEsLw6ZCFg8bChQjPuJjX5qRNWZkfg_wvT_ZKiZnRLqn7w62pLYaRZb3IDvs91DwMN4LMK0zM5_MFc807zLnGuek1OQNUkY6fv1GMaLi1kvjXk0ehAEmThXwM67TZJHDtQABVjuiOoh00XIIwd6TGcw_by1mf1jktLUgHoIAjRDQgYmGcwpNgs8JC1bpey\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi2dE5zb7-w1PTQrNUXICsJgbuf8pmiiS2IzOrb3UbeUfMWdbH9e1Udh8xgYWzCh2xiGmrFhxpp_37YVyo7htOrAXcpoRcmGWEjWdBd_oXql7N61FTzXVCVjJMRQcJ4zMUa1vwYFM88YIR4VOB1Qat2jXZy4q0IdLwsTYvRiEchQU-Zk8DiQGyQv111aouV\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhImaAArrzOpLRRr7EdzWmXklRbAe2-BRUzaTUNJBvC9lgaMgX32z3VMNTHhVWC4MRAXGTnlXz3GvW8xdnSzTnVEaTRgiz5sbbga1VuTpmoBEUHVg1U5_faGuoQ9HQNyYezXXDPRCutU0Pgy6KFG_Idsv4TS_sZieKc5JPv0kLrj8k7q5uPW-ZS7r6hZEKx\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhImaAArrzOpLRRr7EdzWmXklRbAe2-BRUzaTUNJBvC9lgaMgX32z3VMNTHhVWC4MRAXGTnlXz3GvW8xdnSzTnVEaTRgiz5sbbga1VuTpmoBEUHVg1U5_faGuoQ9HQNyYezXXDPRCutU0Pgy6KFG_Idsv4TS_sZieKc5JPv0kLrj8k7q5uPW-ZS7r6hZEKx=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">自長期蹛三峽以來，久久--à tsiah ē tńg去彰化一斗。80 thóng歲ê彰化人，suah kiōng-beh tsiânn做北部人。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">三峽三面倚山，tshiâng-tsāi落sap-sap仔雨，天氣kah基隆淡薄仔sio-siāng，不而過，好tshit-thô ê所在mā真濟。聽講，tsia除了原本leh種作田園ê百姓掠外，lóng是外地新搬--入-來ê人，致使kuân樓一棟一棟起--起-去、樹欉也一欉一欉種--落-去，感覺三峽ê kuân樓ná像lóng hōo綠蔭大道圍tiâu--leh，綠意深深、空氣好、起居方便、好生活。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">愈tsia̍p來三峽蹛查某囝ê厝，tsiah知影當地人早暗行踏ê所在，m̄-nā臺北大學三峽校區thang好去niā-niā。北大真理堂kah大有路63號ê長樂健康巷弄長照站，是阮查某囝tshiâng-tsāi安排阮翁仔姐去游閒、消tháu、育樂兼顧ê場所，kah蹛彰化m̄知beh行去佗有大大差別。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">食老憑頭來，tuè人去讀英語課，按「a、b、c」開始，無所謂深淺，mā tsiah知影以早拍ê基礎無夠在；聽牧師講道，翻頭看íng過，ē愈珍惜現此時ê一切。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">三峽路頭遠，tshiâng-tsāi ài起落車，一般ê朋友少人ē行跤到，恬靜恬靜，是讀冊、學習、游閒ê好所在。食老m̄知老，佳哉tsit幾年ê身體iáu ē得做主，精彩ê人生拄開始niā-niā。</span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57qpf3tszsERaP1wzHewE3ccUJwLuN6ugYeGLt8bKAtxl6BeernGPRv5vdRD0cTG8JmI-k7jApdtgCDytGX\" style=\"background-color: white; font-family: arial; font-size: large; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em; text-align: center;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"512\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEheiPHFkAqGShp9loyQMHLNVr2XP3eL2YQrCvRqi2OhNHXdITg1lxY85CLb_i7X7KqFMdAAtvs_y18hNW6KhS8u2K-07F6HFpJ5R-G3S_JDT57qpf3tszsERaP1wzHewE3ccUJwLuN6ugYeGLt8bKAtxl6BeernGPRv5vdRD0cTG8JmI-k7jApdtgCDytGX=w451-h640\" width=\"451\" /></a></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div></span><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; f